{"material_id":"mat_b35042356bf7","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"op2kjf327vilvhbxkjicxg5ec","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","author_followers":null,"title":"Reddit 宣布转向以登录为主的体验，以应对 AI 搜索带来的流量下滑","excerpt":"Reddit 在 Q3 财报中宣布将转向以登录为主的体验，以保护数据免受 AI 抓取并提升广告变现。10 月搜索流量平均每周减少超 100 万次引荐，Q3 全球日活为 1.303 亿，其中美国日活降至 5070 万，同比降 2%。Q3 收入同比增长 53% 至 8.95 亿美元，净利润 2.83 亿美元；该转变将先在美国以外市场测试，暂无全球上线时间表。","source_url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/29/as-search-traffic-dries-up-reddit-announces-its-shifting-to-a-logged-in-experience/","canonical_url":"https://techcrunch.com/2026/10/29/as-search-traffic-dries-up-reddit-announces-its-shifting-to-a-logged-in-experience","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-10-29T20:08:31.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-10-30T06:53:45.733Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"rejected","rejection_reasons":["low_relevance","below_overall_threshold"],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"TechCrunch：AI（RSS）","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["ai_news"],"relevance_score":25,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":55,"fingerprint":"b35042356bf7a80acb00fe468eca3a4a54e787b11894d380c121817ba6a359d9","content_fingerprint":"daf8373736298f9049ea1df08505455c5f85c57251a043d5e23ca2022d71c795"}
